# House Price Prediction - Literature Review

A comprehensive collection of research papers and methodologies focusing on real estate price forecasting using Machine Learning and Deep Learning.

## 📚 Selected Research Papers

* **[2026] Enhanced Real Estate Price Prediction using Hybrid Gradient Boosting**
  * **Focus:** Hybrid Gradient Boosting and Spatial Feature Engineering.
  * **Authors:** A. Al-Qahtani, S. Malik, and J. Zhang.
  * **Link:** [View Paper](https://doi.org/10.1109/CONF-CDS)

* **[2025] Real-Time Housing Market Trends Analysis using Deep Learning**
  * **Focus:** Big Data and Deep Learning for real-time trends.
  * **Authors:** R. Kumar and K. Singh.
  * **Link:** [View Paper](https://doi.org/10.1109/ICBDSC)

* **[2024] Predicting House Price Model: A Comprehensive Analysis**
  * **Focus:** Comparative analysis of Random Forest and Decision Trees.
  * **Authors:** M. Sharma, D. Sharma, R. Burle, et al.
  * **Link:** [10.1109/INOCON60754.2024.10511732](https://doi.org/10.1109/INOCON60754.2024.10511732)

* **[2023] A Novel Hybrid House Price Prediction Model**
  * **Focus:** Introduction of new hybrid modeling techniques.
  * **Authors:** S. Ö. Akyüz, B. E. Erdogan, Ö. Yıldız, and P. K. Ataş.
  * **Link:** [10.1007/s10614-022-10298-8](https://doi.org/10.1007/s10614-022-10298-8)

* **[2020] Housing Price Prediction via Improved Machine Learning Techniques**
  * **Focus:** Optimization of regression-based ML models.
  * **Authors:** Q. Truong, M. Nguyen, H. Dang, and B. Mei.
  * **Link:** [10.1016/j.procs.2020.06.111](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.procs.2020.06.111)

* **[2020] House Price Prediction using Machine Learning: A Survey**
  * **Focus:** A comprehensive literature survey of initial ML applications.
  * **Authors:** N. H. Zulkifley, S. A. Rahman, N. H. Ubaidullah, and I. Ibrahim.
  * **Link:** [10.5815/ijmecs.2020.06.04](https://doi.org/10.5815/ijmecs.2020.06.04)

## 🛠 Technologies & Methods
* **Algorithms:** Random Forest, Gradient Boosting, Deep Learning, Decision Trees.
